"name": "Inter Cars S.A.",
"description": "Inter Cars S.A. is engages in the import and distribution of spare parts for cars and commercial vehicles. Its products include garage equipment for tire changers and wheel balance; lifts; diagnostic testers; as well as tools, spare parts and, accessories for automotive. The firm also offers services for liquefied petroleum gas installations, warm-up and injection systems, air-conditioning and tuning. The company was founded by Krzysztof Oleksowicz, Andrzej Oliszewski and Piotr Oleksowicz in 1990 and is headquartered in Warsaw, Poland.",
